# --------------------------------------------------------- the profile

[break] the-profile-reads-the-clock-when-off
rule: With CINERIS_TESTKIT_PROFILE unset, a mark describes nothing and reads no clock.
file: crates/cineris-testkit/src/profile.rs
in: Mark::start
find: open: recorder().map(|_| (kind, what(), Instant::now()))
replace: open: Some((kind, what(), Instant::now()))
caught-by:
    cineris-testkit profile::tests::off_it_reads_no_clock_and_keeps_nothing

[break] a-phase-is-counted-twice
rule: The time in phases counts each stretch once, however phases nest.
file: crates/cineris-testkit/src/profile.rs
in: union
find: let (start, end) = (start.max(reached), end.min(to));
replace: let (start, end) = (start, end.min(to));
caught-by:
    cineris-testkit profile::tests::a_report_lists_the_phases_and_waits_in_order_with_the_start

